---
/**
 * Why experiences vary:
 * Route, food, individual differences, previous experience.
 */
import SectionShare from './SectionShare';
---

<section id="variables" class="w-full bg-surface-container-low border-b border-outline-variant/30">
  <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-stack-md reveal">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 flex-wrap">
        <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary font-bold">
          Variables
        </span>
        <SectionShare
          client:idle
          anchor="variables"
          title="Why the Same Draw Can Feel Different"
          text="See why context can change how a similar visual draw develops."
        />
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary">Why the same draw can feel different.</h2>
      <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
        Even with a consistent visual fill, several factors influence how an experience develops from one day to the next.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-gutter mt-12 reveal-group">
      <div class="bg-surface rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-outline-variant/40">
        <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">Route</h3>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          Holding a tincture under the tongue versus swallowing it directly routes the liquid differently and changes the timing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-surface rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-outline-variant/40">
        <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">Food</h3>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          Recent meals, stomach contents, and dietary fats naturally alter how swallowed liquids pass through the digestive system.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-surface rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-outline-variant/40">
        <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">Individual Differences</h3>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          Every person’s digestive pace and personal physiology are unique. Two people taking the same draw may experience different timing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-surface rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-outline-variant/40">
        <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">Previous Experience</h3>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          Your familiarity with cannabis and how frequently you use it can affect how noticeable or subtle an experience feels.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 p-6 bg-secondary-container/40 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/40 reveal">
      <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-secondary-container leading-relaxed">
        Compare your own experiences under similar conditions instead of copying someone else’s routine.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
